# Node
node_modules/
dist/

# What the tool-simulation harnesses render into the working directory
*-sheet.png
*-shot.png
*-zoom.png

# The desktop shell (tauri/). Its Rust build output, the site copied in from
# `dist/` by scripts/bundle-web.mjs, and the permission schemas tauri-build
# generates from tauri.conf.json. The ICONS beside them are committed —
# they're the app's mark, generated by `make icons` like every other icon
# this repo ships.
tauri/target/
tauri/webroot/*
!tauri/webroot/.gitkeep
tauri/src-tauri/gen/

# Store submission OUTPUT, and the listing's own WORDS. The RULES stay
# committed (native/store/listing.mts) and a SKELETON documents the shape
# (copy.example.mts); the marketing copy is what a store indexes and a
# competitor reads, so it is not published here. Nothing backs it up — keep a
# copy outside the checkout.
native/store/copy.mts

native/store/store.config.json
native/store/screenshots/
native/fastlane/metadata/
